    "detailed_description": "Farm Invaders is a rogue-like shoot 'em up based on the Seraph's Last Stand, where in each run you select a character with unique abilities and try to survive while killing as many aliens as you can. Every wave you select an upgrade and try to win the game. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669300/extras/22ecfa6dd5736d8f2936c92687745eeb.poster.avif?t=1704827960\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669300/extras/22ecfa6dd5736d8f2936c92687745eeb.webm?t=1704827960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669300/extras/22ecfa6dd5736d8f2936c92687745eeb.mp4?t=1704827960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>You start clean every playthrough, but if you choose the right combinations, you can snowballs into powerful builds:</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669300/extras/318f8ad3e9c57a67afd53ce2470b1593.poster.avif?t=1704827960\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669300/extras/318f8ad3e9c57a67afd53ce2470b1593.webm?t=1704827960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669300/extras/318f8ad3e9c57a67afd53ce2470b1593.mp4?t=1704827960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Multiple characters with unique abilities.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669300/extras/a6f37ff0b6c727ddc0536e35f4ceadd6.poster.avif?t=1704827960\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669300/extras/a6f37ff0b6c727ddc0536e35f4ceadd6.webm?t=1704827960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669300/extras/a6f37ff0b6c727ddc0536e35f4ceadd6.mp4?t=1704827960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Play with friends.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669300/extras/d0c8461f638a8234bfd2b2955658e396.poster.avif?t=1704827960\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669300/extras/d0c8461f638a8234bfd2b2955658e396.webm?t=1704827960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669300/extras/d0c8461f638a8234bfd2b2955658e396.mp4?t=1704827960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Some features of the game are:</strong><br><br>- 40+ different items to compose your builds and secret items you discover by stacking.<br>- Multiple characters with unique abilities.<br>- 11 Ascensions.",
